    "deleteGroupClusterGlobalWriteCustomZoneMapping": {
      "description": "Removes all custom zone mappings for the specified global cluster. A custom zone mapping matches one ISO 3166-2 location code to a zone in your global cluster. Removing the custom zone mappings restores the default mapping. By default, MongoDB Cloud maps each location code to the closest geographical zone.",
